"2": {
"caption": "The ink took a dropped scrap without a sound. It did not float. Patch watched the place where it had been for a long moment.",
"size": Vector2(128, 384)
},
"3": {
"caption": "Old pilings, and between them, things that had drowned in the flood and come back up wrong.",
"size": Vector2(128, 384)
},
"4": {
"caption": "The chains here had been strung by somebody, once, to cross the harbor floor at low tide. Most of them still held.",
"size": Vector2(128, 384)
},
"5": {
"caption": "Ahead, the ink was moving. Slowly, all of it, in one direction, the way a chest moves.",
"size": Vector2(128, 384)
},
